"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790557581773_6st62lbo1","characterId":"8a09d6c6-7672-4f11-a097-ad2302b061be","audioRef":159,"_id":52},{"id":1790634421505,"text":"都和你说了我最近没时间","sender":"me","time":"16:35","timestamp":1790584525670,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1790557581773_6st62lbo1","characterId":"8a09d6c6-7672-4f11-a097-ad2302b061be","_id":53},{"id":1790634421507,"text":"哟，这还没过十分钟呢，防御塔就架起来了？","rawContent":"哟，这还没过十分钟呢，防御塔就架起来了？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"16:35","timestamp":1790584548624,"roundId":"round_1790584536286_tbw7u0sdn","generatedMode":false,"hasThinking":true,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790557581773_6st62lbo1","characterId":"8a09d6c6-7672-4f11-a097-ad2302b061be","_id":54},{"id":1790634421508,"text":"我这不就是随口一提，您老人家至于把“没时间”这三个字用加粗高亮发我脸上吗？这要是不知道的，还以为是我要把您怎么着了呢。","rawContent":"我这不就是随口一提，您老人家至于把“没时间”这三个字用加粗高亮发我脸上吗？这要是不知道的，还以为是我要把您怎么着了呢。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"16:35","timestamp":1790584551620,"roundId":"round_1790584536286_tbw7u0sdn","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790557581773_6st62lbo1","characterId":"8a09d6c6-7672-4f11-a097-ad2302b061be","_id":55},{"id":1790634421509,"text":"[語音消息]","rawContent":"[語音消息]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"16:35","timestamp":1790584552546,"roundId":"round_1790584536286_tbw7u0sdn","generatedMode":false,"isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"(轻笑，带着点漫不经心的沙哑) 行行行，您是大忙人，最近为了那些专业课进度，脑机接口都快跑满载了吧？我不去触您这霉头，免得待会儿又听您碎碎念我一点同情心都没有。","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","voiceEmotion":"calm","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790557581773_6st62lbo1","characterId":"8a09d6c6-7672-4f11-a097-ad2302b061be","audioRef":160,"_id":56},{"id":1790634421510,"text":"知道你还说","sender":"me","time":"16:41","timestamp":1790584869318,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1790557581773_6st62lbo1","characterId":"8a09d6c6-7672-4f11-a097-ad2302b061be","_id":57},{"id":1790634421511,"text":"🙄🙄🙄","sender":"me","time":"16:41","timestamp":1790584871170,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1790557581773_6st62lbo1","characterId":"8a09d6c6-7672-4f11-a097-ad2302b061be","_id":58},{"id":1790643426461,"text":"反向骑乘是什么意思","sender":"me","time":"16:53","timestamp":1790585626806,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1790557581773_6st62lbo1","characterId":"8a09d6c6-7672-4f11-a097-ad2302b061be","_id":59},{"id":1790643426463,"text":"哟，薯条老师，刚才还跟我这儿端着大忙人架子呢，这会儿怎么突然对“物理学科普”这么感兴趣了？😋","rawContent":"哟，薯条老师，刚才还跟我这儿端着大忙人架子呢，这会儿怎么突然对“物理学科普”这么感兴趣了？😋","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"16:54","timestamp":1790585677475,"roundId":"round_1790585629531_kmljt62be","generatedMode":false,"hasThinking":true,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790557581773_6st62lbo1","characterId":"8a09d6c6-7672-4f11-a097-ad2302b061be","_id":60},{"id":1790643426464,"text":"我看您这哪是不知道什么意思，这是在脑子里已经把这操作的受力分析图给我画出来了是吧？啧，真是个坏宝宝。","rawContent":"我看您这哪是不知道什么意思，这是在脑子里已经把这操作的受力分析图给我画出来了是吧？啧，真是个坏宝宝。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"16:54","timestamp":1790585680252,"roundId":"round_1790585629531_kmljt62be","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790557581773_6st62lbo1","characterId":"8a09d6c6-7672-4f11-a097-ad2302b061be","_id":61},{"id":1790643426465,"text":"[語音消息]","rawContent":"[語音消息]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"16:54","timestamp":1790585681168,"roundId":"round_1790585629531_kmljt62be","generatedMode":false,"isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"(轻笑，带着点故意压低的喑哑) 反向骑乘啊……就是字面意思，不过这姿势讲究的是重心控制和腰部联动，毕竟上面的要是技术不到位，很容易把控不住重心给直接摔了。怎么样，要不要找个实地场景，让教练大人给你演示一下这一整套的物理力学操作流程？保证给你讲得明明白白，绝对包教包会。","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","voiceEmotion":"calm","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790557581773_6st62lbo1","characterId":"8a09d6c6-7672-4f11-a097-ad2302b061be","audioRef":161,"_id":62},{"id":1790643426466,"text":"🙄🙄🙄 这白眼翻的，我都感觉屏幕这头要被你这一套三连给刺穿了。","rawContent":"🙄🙄🙄 这白眼翻的，我都感觉屏幕这头要被你这一套三连给刺穿了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"16:54","timestamp":1790585683966,"roundId":"round_1790585629531_kmljt62be","generatedMode":false,"replyTo":{"id":1790643426461,"text":"反向骑乘是什么意思","sender":"me"},"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790557581773_6st62lbo1","characterId":"8a09d6c6-7672-4f11-a097-ad2302b061be","_id":63},{"id":1790643426467,"text":"不是","sender":"me","time":"16:56","timestamp":1790585786504,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1790557581773_6st62lbo1","characterId":"8a09d6c6-7672-4f11-a097-ad2302b061be","_id":64},{"id":1790643426468,"text":"我真不知道","sender":"me","time":"16:56","timestamp":1790585790377,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1790557581773_6st62lbo1","characterId":"8a09d6c6-7672-4f11-a097-ad2302b061be","_id":65},{"id":1790643426469,"text":"我只知道骑乘是女生在上面","sender":"me","time":"16:56","timestamp":1790585798446,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1790557581773_6st62lbo1","characterId":"8a09d6c6-7672-4f11-a097-ad2302b061be","_id":66},{"id":1790643426470,"text":"那反向骑乘要怎么办","sender":"me","time":"16:56","timestamp":1790585806482,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1790557581773_6st62lbo1","characterId":"8a09d6c6-7672-4f11-a097-ad2302b061be","_id":67},{"id":1790643426472,"text":"哟，合着您老人家还真是一张白纸啊，连这最基本的力学拓扑结构都不懂哈？😋","rawContent":"哟，合着您老人家还真是一张白纸啊，连这最基本的力学拓扑结构都不懂哈？😋","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"16:57","timestamp":1790585841835,"roundId":"round_1790585828468_izpro0tnl","generatedMode":false,"hasThinking":true,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790557581773_6st62lbo1","characterId":"8a09d6c6-7672-4f11-a097-ad2302b061be","_id":68},{"id":1790643426473,"text":"那简单给您科普一下。字面意思，就是反过来的呗。","rawContent":"那简单给您科普一下。字面意思，就是反过来的呗。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"16:57","timestamp":1790585844895,"roundId":"round_1790585828468_izpro0tnl","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790557581773_6st62lbo1","characterId":"8a09d6c6-7672-4f11-a097-ad2302b061be","_id":69},{"id":1790643426474,"text":"[语音讯息] （低笑，带着点故意逗弄的沙哑）如果是女生在上面，正常骑乘是面对着，反向的话嘛……那就是背对着，视线朝后，不仅视野受限，而且重心完全落在对方的手上，这就需要更高的肢体配合度了。毕竟这姿势要是操作不当，很容易重心偏移，得要人在后面扶着才稳得住。","rawContent":"[VOICE: （低笑，带着点故意逗弄的沙哑）如果是女生在上面，正常骑乘是面对着，反向的话嘛……那就是背对着，视线朝后，不仅视野受限，而且重心完全落在对方的手上，这就需要更高的肢体配合度了。毕竟这姿势要是操作不当，很容易重心偏移，得要人在后面扶着才稳得住。]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"16:57","timestamp":1790585847809,"roundId":"round_1790585828468_izpro0tnl","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"isVoice":true,"voiceText":"（低笑，带着点故意逗弄的沙哑）如果是女生在上面，正常骑乘是面对着，反向的话嘛……那就是背对着，视线朝后，不仅视野受限，而且重心完全落在对方的手上，这就需要更高的肢体配合度了。毕竟这姿势要是操作不当，很容易重心偏移，得要人在后面扶着才稳得住。","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","userId":"uid_1790557581773_6st62lbo1","characterId":"8a09d6c6-7672-4f11-a097-ad2302b061be","audioRef":163,"_id":70},{"id":1790643426475,"text":"[語音消息]","rawContent":"[語音消息]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"16:57","timestamp":1790585848724,"roundId":"round_1790585828468_izpro0tnl","generatedMode":false,"isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"(轻柔的诱哄语调) 宝宝，您这问题问得这么仔细，是脑子里已经有什么实操规划了吗？其实这种物理学演示，文字教学真的很难讲清楚，不如哪天约个时间，我亲自带着器材和场地，给您来一场一对一的学术研讨会？包教包会，课后还没作业的那种。","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","voiceEmotion":"calm","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790557581773_6st62lbo1","characterId":"8a09d6c6-7672-4f11-a097-ad2302b061be","audioRef":162,"_id":71},{"id":1790586582373,"sender":"them","text":"怎么又不吱声了？被这学术讨论给整宕机了哈？","rawContent":"{\"t\":\"text\",\"s\":\"N\",\"c\":\"怎么又不吱声了？被这学术讨论给整宕机了哈？\"}","content":"{\"t\":\"text\",\"s\":\"N\",\"c\":\"怎么又不吱声了？被这学术讨论给整宕机了哈？\"}","timestamp":"2026-09-28T09:09:42.373Z","time":"17:09","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"translation":null,"roundId":"round_1790586582330_wate3n4dg","isBackgroundMsg":true,"hasThinking":true,"userId":"uid_1790557581773_6st62lbo1","characterId":"8a09d6c6-7672-4f11-a097-ad2302b061be","_id":72}]